<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cons Modder Sept qtr distrib profit slips.</title>
<headline>Cons Modder Sept qtr distrib profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Sept versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable profit			     3.24  vs  4.29</p>
<p>    Capital spending				   0.26  vs  0.13</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled				    113,490 vs 111,834</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)				 467.71  vs 469.14</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)					4.12 vs 4.19</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)				    48,250 vs 44,833</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)				 55,526 vs 54,071</p>
<p>Full name: Consolidated Modderfontein Mines Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its interest bearing debt was almost cleared with only 0.6 million rand still outstanding. It said working costs remained under tight control and that the benefits of extra outlays would start to improve results soon.</p>
<p>The company said that development results for the past three months had been very encouraging and were expected to continue.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
